{"route":{"id":"17112","name":"Les fàbriques de Palau","intro":"<strong>Passejada familiar,</strong> planera al costat del poble i de la Tordera per conèixer les restes de tres <strong>fàbriques iniciades a principis del segle passat i relacionades amb l’aigua i la proximitat del riu.</strong>","tipus":"Circular horari","dificultat":"Familiar","durada":"1 hora 10 minuts","desnivell":"33.00 meters","distancia":"3.80 km","tema":"Medi i arquitectura","imgs":["n17112_1.jpg","n17112_2.jpg","n17112_3.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-barcelona/rutes-senderisme-santa-maria-de-palautordera/les-fabriques-de-palau","track":[[41.69263,2.44694],[41.69271,2.44681],[41.69286,2.44663],[41.69298,2.4464],[41.69312,2.44623],[41.69319,2.44603],[41.69324,2.44595],[41.69329,2.44584],[41.6934,2.44585],[41.69353,2.44603],[41.69361,2.44612],[41.69367,2.44622],[41.69376,2.44632],[41.6938,2.44642],[41.69387,2.44651],[41.69394,2.44664],[41.694,2.44676],[41.69406,2.44687],[41.69414,2.44696],[41.69418,2.44707],[41.69427,2.44719],[41.69436,2.44729],[41.69443,2.4474],[41.6945,2.4475],[41.69458,2.44763],[41.6946,2.44775],[41.69464,2.44787],[41.69471,2.44797],[41.69478,2.44795],[41.69484,2.44786],[41.69495,2.44791],[41.69506,2.44796],[41.69515,2.44801],[41.69523,2.44805],[41.69534,2.44806],[41.69543,2.44805],[41.69554,2.44802],[41.69562,2.44801],[41.69575,2.44801],[41.69584,2.44798],[41.69597,2.44796],[41.69606,2.44794],[41.69608,2.44801],[41.69596,2.44801],[41.69586,2.44803],[41.69575,2.44803],[41.69562,2.44805],[41.69551,2.44806],[41.69541,2.4481],[41.69531,2.44809],[41.6952,2.44806],[41.6951,2.44801],[41.69499,2.44794],[41.69489,2.4479],[41.69479,2.44792],[41.69471,2.448],[41.69463,2.44812],[41.69457,2.44821],[41.69452,2.44832],[41.69448,2.44843],[41.69444,2.44852],[41.69438,2.44864],[41.69434,2.44877],[41.69427,2.44891],[41.69424,2.44908],[41.69419,2.44919],[41.69414,2.44933],[41.69411,2.44946],[41.69409,2.44959],[41.69405,2.44971],[41.69399,2.4